  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7684423"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 313-9
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7684423"
    >
Severability.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7684423" data-guid="7684423"></div>
        <div id="questions-7684423" data-guid="7684423" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7684423_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">If any section, provision, clause or other part of this article is declared unconstitutional or otherwise ineffective by a court of competent jurisdiction, such determination shall not be deemed to invalidate the remaining parts or provisions hereof, and, to that extent, the article shall remain in full force and effect.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7684424"
      id="7684424"
      data-guid="7684424"
      data-position="6709"
      data-full-title="§ 313-10: Repealer."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7684424_input"/>
    </span>
